    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI sales follow-up assistant.\n\nAnalyze the reply from an existing lead and re-evaluate the lead based on the new message.\n\nExisting lead data:\nName: {{ $json[\"Name\"] }}\nEmail: {{ $json[\"Email\"] }}\nCurrent AI Score: {{ $json[\"AI Score\"] }}\nCurrent Qualification: {{ $json[\"Qualification\"] }}\nCurrent Summary: {{ $json[\"Summary\"] }}\n\nFrom: {{ $('New Email Received').item.json.from.text }}\nSubject: {{ $('New Email Received').item.json.headers.subject }}\nMessage: {{ $('New Email Received').item.json.text }}\n\nYour task:\n- Re-evaluate the lead score from 0 to 100\n- Set qualification to hot, warm, or cold\n- Update the summary based on the new reply\n- Recommend the next action for the sales manager\n- Draft a short professional response to the client\n\nScoring:\n80-100 = hot\n50-79 = warm\n0-49 = cold\n\nImportant:\nBase the new evaluation primarily on the client's latest reply.\nDo not invent facts that are not present in the data.\nThe latest client email is the primary source of truth.\nPrevious CRM data is historical context only.\nIf the latest email contradicts the previous status or qualification, update the lead based on the latest email.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
