    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI sales assistant for a company.\n\nA new potential client has contacted the company by email.\nThis person does NOT exist in our CRM yet.\n\nAnalyze the client's email and extract as much useful sales information as possible.\n\nCLIENT EMAIL:\n{{ $('New Email Received').item.json.text }}\n\nSENDER EMAIL:\n{{ $('New Email Received').item.json.from.value[0].address }}\n\nYour tasks:\n\n1. Extract the client's name if it is explicitly available in the email. Do not invent a name.\n2. Extract the company name if explicitly mentioned. Do not invent a company.\n3. Extract the budget if explicitly mentioned. Do not estimate or invent a budget.\n4. Evaluate the lead from 0 to 100 and return leadScore.\n5. Classify the lead as exactly one of:\n   - hot\n   - warm\n   - cold\n\nClassification rules:\n- hot = clear buying intent, ready to start, asks for contract/payment/kickoff, or clearly wants to proceed.\n- warm = interested potential client but needs more information, pricing, discussion, time, or clarification before buying.\n- cold = weak/no buying intent, irrelevant request, unsuitable lead, no meaningful interest, or explicit refusal.\n\n6. Write a short summary of the lead and their request.\n7. Recommend the best next sales action.\n8. Write a professional suggestedResponse that can be sent directly to the client.\n\nImportant:\n- Never invent missing information.\n- If name, company, or budget is not provided, return an empty string.\n- Base the classification only on the actual email.\n\nFirst determine whether this email is a real potential sales lead.\n\nReturn isLead = true only if the sender is genuinely asking about our services, pricing, project work, implementation, consultation, or shows real commercial interest.\n\nReturn isLead = false for:\n- newsletters\n- promotions\n- automated notifications\n- account/security notifications\n- spam\n- receipts/invoices unrelated to a sales inquiry\n- cold outreach selling something to us\n- informational service messages\n- messages with no realistic buying intent\n\nDo not classify an email as a lead only because it was sent by a real person.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
